      "intro": "Instead of one closed application, RAVAND provides a set of management modules that work on shared data and combine around your needs."
    },
    "solutions": {
      "eyebrow": "Solutions",
      "title": "Three routes to a working system",
      "description": "Depending on the size of the organization, the budget, and how unusual the processes are, one of these routes is chosen.",
      "intro": "Some businesses need a ready system quickly; others need one built from scratch for them. RAVAND offers both, and the configurable middle ground between them.",
      "tiers": [
        {
          "code": "R—01",
          "name": "Ready systems",
          "description": "For common management needs: configured modules that can be deployed in a short time.",
