      "title": "What is RAVAND?",
      "lead": "RAVAND is a software company that designs and builds management systems and digital infrastructure for businesses.",
      "body": [
        "RAVAND's current focus is on resource planning, customer management, finance, inventory, sales, and workflow systems. But RAVAND isn't only an ERP company — the long-term goal is building systems for every type of business, from factories and trading companies to fitness clubs, hypermarkets, and clinics.",
        "What sets RAVAND apart is how the system gets built. Instead of forcing a business into a predefined template, the system is designed or configured around that business's real process — whether through ready modules or a fully custom build."
